        <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>Perform a check on some markup to see if it looks like XML
that&apos;s not XHTML. If so, issue a warning.

This is much less reliable than doing the check while parsing,
but some of the tree builders can&apos;t do that.

:param stacklevel: The stacklevel of the code calling this\
 function.

:return: True if the markup looks like non-XHTML XML, False
 otherwise.
</verbatim> </para>
